{"ambiguities":[],"artifact_kind":"draft","category_review":{"ambiguities":"None requiring resolution.","entities":"D1 declares the artifact, typed entry, representations and normative value semantics.","error_semantics":"Malformed-input behavior is excluded by N1.","explicit_non_goals":"N1 excludes malformed-input behavior; N2 records excluded campaigns and assurance layers.","invariants":"Input immutability is covered by S1.","liveness_properties":"Total execution is covered by O2.","postconditions":"O1 specifies the universal signed floor sum; O2 specifies total pure deterministic typed execution and serialization.","preconditions":"A1 records only the explicitly supplied schema and bounds.","resource_constraints":"No physical-resource assurance or constraint is requested.","safety_properties":"S1 prohibits effects and mutation; S2 requires exact unbounded integer arithmetic."},"entities":[{"acceptance_criteria":["program.vscore.json contains exactly one admitted typed entry named solve under the specified source, semantics and serialization profiles.","The typed input represents n, m, a and b, and the output represents one exact integer with the specified structure and ordering.","Arbitrary signed a and b, including magnitudes of 10^30 and larger, are represented without an added magnitude bound.","String values and comparisons follow Unicode-scalar and scalar-codepoint semantics."],"dependencies":[],"id":"D1","kind":"entity","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"declarations carry no end-to-end correctness claim","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation prop