nt_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1653,"interpretation":"Functional meaning remains unchanged.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1552},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1733,"interpretation":"Preserve O1 identity, role and required flag.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1654},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1985,"interpretation":"Complete mathematical statement and universal refinement.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1874},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":2026,"interpretation":"Examples do not replace the universal guarantee.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1986},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":3628,"interpretation":"O1 revised delivery metadata.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":2085}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"For every input satisfying A1, solve returns the exact integer sum Σ(i=0 to n-1) floor((a*i+b)/m). For each i, the floor is the unique integer q satisfying q*m <= a*i+b < (q+1)*m, including negative numerators. The empty sum for n=0 is zero. The admitted implementation must universally refine this complete mathematical specification and preserve both public examples: {a:-2,b:1,m:3,n:4} returns -4 and {a:100,b:-99,m:7,n:0} returns 0. Example agreement does not replace universal refinement."},{"acceptance_criteria":["Every admitted typed execution is total, pure and deterministic.","Every valid input yields the required result representation with the specified structure and exact ordering.","No additional input restrictions are imposed.","The delivery i